    <h1>Traditional web agency vs. <em>one person who builds and looks after your site</em></h1>
    <p>A regional agency brings a team of specialists and usually quotes $5,000 to $15,000 for a website, plus a maintenance retainer. This page compares what you get for that money, who does the work, and how it holds up after the first year.</p>
  </div>
