    <h2>What one extra call a week is worth</h2>
    <p>An agency quote looks like one number, such as $8,000, but it grows with maintenance, per-change fees, and often a rebuild about three years later. In a worked example for a typical local business, a $500 average job and one extra call a week come to $26,000 a year in potential work. For a site of five to 15 pages that must rank locally and work on phones, custom code with direct support fits better. It costs about half as much over five years and scores much higher on speed.</p>

